    # Reconciliation compares a filed declaracion and its justificante against
    # the local calculation. Both arrive as externally-authored documents an
    # INBOUND adapter parses; this module consumes those parses and owns only
    # the comparison. Same class as the einvoice pins, previously admitted by
    # a broad wildcard without review.
    cadrumo.application.registry.filed_state -> cadrumo.adapters.outbound.aeat.sede.declarations_observations
    cadrumo.application.registry.filed_state -> cadrumo.adapters.outbound.aeat.sede.observation_store
