    cadrumo.application.state_projection -> cadrumo.adapters.persistence.**
    # The Sheets parity harness drives the outbound Google client; the export
    # mirror is one-way, so this reaches no persistence at all.
    cadrumo.application.storage.calc_sheets.parity_harness -> cadrumo.adapters.outbound.google.calc_sheets_apply
    # Reaches NO persistence: the second pin in this sweep whose storage-shaped
    # The workflow run-contract surface reports whether a browser session can be
    # established, so it names the outbound browser adapter alongside its
    # persistence reach.
    # The shared secure-SQL test helper wraps the real persistence adapter for
    # roundtrip-discipline tests; ignoring its adapter edge breaks the layer
    # path for every application/domain test that routes fixtures through it.
    cadrumo.tests.secure_sql -> cadrumo.adapters.**
    # The test-only ephemeral master-key provider composes the public storage
    # and master-key facades. Classify this exact shared-helper edge so tests
    # can exercise real session lifecycle without weakening production layers.
    cadrumo.tests.master_key -> cadrumo.adapters.**
    # The shared justificante parse-cache test helper imports the inbound
