    #    adapter behind ProrrataRegisterRepositoryProtocol; these application
    #    modules retain only the sanctioned default-construction edge (ADR
    #    sec. 538). The storage edge is _prorrata_regularizacion's direct import
    #    of the ClassificationError/DecryptionError/EnvelopeVersionError boundary
    #    exception classes (plain exceptions, no port to invert). ──
    cadrumo.application.calculations.prorrata_regularizacion -> cadrumo.adapters.persistence.storage.errors
    cadrumo.application.modelo.revision_persistence -> cadrumo.adapters.persistence.profile.prorrata_register
